ord’s momentum, and allows me to maintain pressure while preserving ♦2 as a top-tier escape card. My teammate likely cannot beat the landlord’s future high cards alone, so seizing this turn is strategic. Passing would let the landlord continue unchallenged, increasing their chance to deplete cards first.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♦A"]}'}
